senses.gloss:
शट् (prob. artificial) cl. 1. P. शटति, to be sick;
to divide, pierce;
to be dissolved;
to be weary or dejected;
to go, Dhātup. ix, 12 : cl. 10. Ā. शाटयते, Dhātup. xxxiii, 18 v.l. for √ 1. शठ्.

सट्ट् cl. 10. P. सट्टयति, to hurt, Dhātup. xxxii, 31;
to be strong, ib.;
to dwell, ib.;
 ‘to take’ or ‘to give’ (दाने v.l. for आदाने).
